+# SURYA: shared SM7150 kernel, RAM-disk-only hardware bring-up.
+#
+# sweet (Redmi Note 10 Pro, SM7150): MASTER.arm64.MacOSX plus the open-source
+# arm64 assembly and pmap (nos_arm_asm, nos_arm_pmap). Apple's own SoC configs
+# link those from the KDK's closed lib<SOC>.os.<CONFIG>.a instead, which is
+# arm64e and Apple-silicon specific. kperf/kpc stay (xnu does not build without
+# kperf); osfmk/arm64/kpc.c is a stub with no hardware counters.
